{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Official QQ Group: 1002455987 \u2014 Feel free to join if you're interested!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventurers exploring the wild have suddenly encountered an attack by the demon army. They must break through the siege and return to warn everyone that the vanguard of the demon world is approaching!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Controls</strong><br>Weapons auto-attack. During combat, players only need to control their character\u2019s movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short Game Sessions</strong><br>Each playthrough lasts no more than 30 minutes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Weapon Choices</strong><br>Weapons include blades, throwing stars, laser cannons, magic wands, and more. Each has its own advantages \u2014 some have high fire rate but low damage, while others offer high damage multipliers but low base attack power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four Character Types</strong><br>Choose from four unique adventurers, each with different strengths: some excel in attack, some in defense, and some are naturally luckier!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Skill Customization</strong><br>Unlock various skills such as enlarged lasers, black holes that attract monsters, and bouncing Yin-Yang orbs. Arrange skill sequences to create powerful combo effects!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In-Game Shop</strong><br>Before each wave of monsters arrives, visit the shop to buy weapons, skills, and items that enhance your abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Up and Earn Gold</strong><br>Defeat monsters to gain experience, level up, and collect gold for the shop. Break through the siege by defeating as many monsters as possible and gathering more coins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A thrilling monster-clearing experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938230/extras/384c1b7197933986e99718e54eb5d292.poster.avif?t=1759420954\" width=384 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938230/extras/384c1b7197933986e99718e54eb5d292.webm?t=1759420954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938230/extras/384c1b7197933986e99718e54eb5d292.mp4?t=1759420954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through upgrading and purchasing items to enhance strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938230/extras/a30b01f30c48665e5e14f6f055df9d6b.poster.avif?t=1759420954\" width=384 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938230/extras/a30b01f30c48665e5e14f6f055df9d6b.webm?t=1759420954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938230/extras/a30b01f30c48665e5e14f6f055df9d6b.mp4?t=1759420954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust skill order then customize skill effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938230/extras/03b13d9b9f0b57c41d4622543e3b1029.poster.avif?t=1759420954\" width=384 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938230/extras/03b13d9b9f0b57c41d4622543e3b1029.webm?t=1759420954\" type=\